==Battleground==
*5 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 0.07~0.67 seconds<sup>2f~20f</sup>.
*10 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 0.07~0.67 seconds<sup>2f~20f</sup>.
*15 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 43.33 seconds<sup>1,300f</sup>, delay 0.07~0.67 seconds<sup>2f~20f</sup>.
*1 [[Assassin Bear]] spawns after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Doge Dark]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
**10 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn, delay 6~8 seconds<sup>180f~240f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn, delay 10~12 seconds<sup>300f~360f</sup>.
**10 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn, delay 10~12 seconds<sup>300f~360f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Gory Dark]]s spawn, delay 14~16 seconds<sup>420f~480f</sup>.

==Strategy==
To aim for the highest score, it is recommended that the player equip cat units with fast attack rate and high DPS such as [[Crazed Cow Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Giraffe Cat]], [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]], [[Crazed Bird Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed UFO Cat]], as well as [[:Category:Anti-Dark Cats|anti-Dark]] cats like [[Sanada Yukimura (Uber Rare Cat)|Sanada Yukimura]]. Due to the vast amount of Doge Darks in the beginning being more than the enemy limit, you can use something with weak damage per hit with [[Area Attack]] such as [[Crazed Cow Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Cow]] or [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Cyborg Cat]] to knockback the Doge Darks behind the base and destroy the base quickly with something like [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] to win the stage, though this is a heavily inconsistent strategy.

